────────────────────────────────────────
✅ 30-second answer (memorize)

“We set the body in ThreadLocal before doFilter. While the request runs inside doFilter, get() works for validation. In finally we remove() so the pooled thread is clean. After remove you cannot use ThreadLocal body — and you don’t need to, because that request is already finished.”
